					<div class="we-card__intro">
						<p>
							Four structured course tracks, taught live by the engineers who build
							ThingsBoard. Written materials and a certificate of completion included.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="we-card__body" id="we-card-train-body" hidden>
						<p class="we-card__opener">
							<strong>Bring your team up to speed — fast.</strong> Live, instructor-led
							training delivered by the engineers who build ThingsBoard. Each track is
